  flavor_bhuvauri.40.t:0 "Half-Orcs Spread Through the Cities"
  flavor_bhuvauri.40.desc:0 "Where once the Bhoorakama were low in number and dispersed throughout the realm, now they congregate within Sramaya, and allow us to introduce them to our academies. While many within the Three Families were hesitant to allow Orcs into the Adasa for fear of their undoubtedly savage nature, these Half-Orcs are a different matter.\n\nWith the strength and resilience of the Bhoorakama, the Adasa would surely have a fearsome frontline force, yet tempered with the better judgement of their human half."
  flavor_bhuvauri.40.a:0 "And so the Adasa grows rich from its diversity."
+
+ flavor_bhuvauri.41.t:0 "Spread the Word..."
+ flavor_bhuvauri.41.desc:0 "Our Ally Bhuvauri has send us invitation to gathering where as they are saying they will show us the light of the Praxis and banish the old darkness from our minds."
+ flavor_bhuvauri.41.a:0 "We gladly accept their invitation."
+ flavor_bhuvauri.41.b:0 "These old fools have nothing better to do?"
+ bhuvari_declined:0 "Declined Bhuvauri Invitation"
+
  flavor_bhuvauri.101.t:0 "Praxic Meritocracy Election: Dakinshi Faction"
  flavor_bhuvauri.101.desc:0 "The time has come for the latest Meritocratic election, this time for the Dakinshi house of Sky-Eyes. The event is awash with ceremony and celebration, a pinnacle of the Praxic Meritocracy we have fostered within great Bhuvauri!\n\nThe house of Sky-Eyes is prized for their mysticism and magics, and as such the candidates reflect this: From the druiduic Dakinshi, to the malleable lizardfolk, who shall we choose?"
